*.profdata

# Generated documentation images. Both galleries are captured in CI on every run — help
# screenshots from Storybook and the live desk, marketing screenshots from Storybook — and the
# help set is embedded into the binary at build time. Committing them only lets them go stale.
# Regenerate locally with `npm run screenshots:help` and `npm run screenshots:marketing`.
/docs/help/assets/screenshots/
/docs/marketing/assets/screenshots/
